cli-assistant (0.9.1) unstable; urgency=medium

  * Interactive shell integration supports bash and zsh (written into the shell
    rc file with a removable marker block); `c feedback` points at the project
    issue tracker; TUI messages wrap and render markdown; `c --help` gained an
    EXAMPLES section.

 -- cli-assistant contributors <wenyinos@users.noreply.github.com>  Wed, 23 Sep 2026 22:30:00 +0800

cli-assistant (0.9.0) unstable; urgency=medium

  * Initial Debian packaging, tracking upstream 0.9.0.
  * Multi-turn conversation context for the interactive and TUI pages, with
    automatic compaction of long histories into a model-written summary.
  * New "c setup" first-run wizard; the package no longer ships a default
    /etc/cli-assistant/config.toml.

 -- cli-assistant contributors <wenyinos@users.noreply.github.com>  Wed, 23 Sep 2026 12:00:00 +0800
